<title>ESTONIA: CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS JUNE 17/18.</title>
<headline>CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS JUNE 17/18.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Estonian central bank</p>
<p>released the following fixings for the Estonian kroon for June</p>
<p>17/18. The Estonian kroon is pegged at eight kroons to a German</p>
<p>mark.</p>
<p>	   June 17/18	  June 16/17</p>
<p> CZK	0.43059	     0.42698</p>
<p> DKK	2.10139	     2.10179</p>
<p> FIM	2.67254	     2.67052</p>
<p> HUF	0.7475		0.07477</p>
<p> JPY	0.12248	     0.12175</p>
<p> LTL	3.47223	     3.46813</p>
<p> LVL     24.3406	     24.30335</p>
<p> RUR	0.00241	     0.00241</p>
<p> SEK	1.78872	     1.78513</p>
<p> UAH	7.48876	     7.48032</p>
<p> USD     13.8924	     13.876</p>
<p> XEU     15.65882	    15.61674</p>
<p>For a full listing see Bank of Estonia </p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202/1 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
